# Ephemora Cell — dev/integration tooling, hash-pinned via uv (single source).
# Regenerate: uv pip compile requirements-dev.in -o requirements-dev.lock --generate-hashes
# Mirrors pyproject [project.optional-dependencies].dev + [integration] plus the
# tool-only packages the CI jobs install ad-hoc (black/ruff/mypy/bandit/pytest/...).
# CI installs with: python -m pip install --require-hashes --no-deps -r requirements-dev.lock
